Incubane was summoned by [[Mr. Wilder]] to fight [[Baselaird|Powerbonded Baselaird]]. When [[Hoffman]] used [[Poisonfang]] on [[Lok]], both Baselaird and Lok were weakened allowing Incubane to hit Baselaird. This resulted in both Titans being defeated and sent back to their [[Amulets]] in combat. {{Source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}

On [[Avalon]], Mr. Wilder used Incubane to attack Lok and [[Sophie]] while searching for the [[Willblade]]. Incubane was temporarily taken over by [[Dendras]] but Mr. Wilder used [[Divine Mirror Kagami]] to reflect the ability, gaining control over Dendras and releasing Incubane from Lok's control. After a fierce battle with Lok, Incubane was defeated by the Titan of Champions, [[Pendragon]]. {{Source|Knight of the Willblade}}

Incubane was invoked by Mr. Wilder to fight the [[Blood Spiral]]'s [[Silent Soldiers]]. He attacked [[Shakrit]] but it defeated him in a single bite. {{Source|The Blood Spiral}}

Incubane fought and overpowered [[Dante]]'s [[Caliban]] but his attacks were blocked by [[Sabriel|Powerbonded Sabriel]]'s "Truth Shield" ability. He was then abruptly defeated by [[Cherit]]. {{Source|Zhalia's Mission}}

Incubane was invoked by Mr. Wilder in [[the Professor's castle]] to fight [[Sophie]]. He set fire to a tapestry in front of Sophie but was defeated by [[Phoenix]]. {{Source|An Ally from the Organization}}
